Hello all,

Patch 1.0.4 is now up. More small changes, but we also managed to fix a bug regarding the player input.

[b]Changelog:[/b]
- Fixed the issue with player custom controls not being saved;
- Fixed an issue wich let player gout outside map bounds in Farm level;
- Removed some placeholders items from Basement which could be collected in inventory;

Raul from RVL Games

Hello all,

[b]First of all, a big, big thank you to everyone who's purchased Classified Stories: The Tome of Myrkah![/b]

We patched the game several times in the last 2 days. On this patch, we fixed some major issues, based on our player's feedback. More details down below.

As we promise, more [i]Quality of life[/i] improvements are on the way.

[b]Patch 1.0.3:[/b]
- Fixed a major bug wich let the player receive more than 1 power unit when reading a single sign;
- Fixed a game-breaking bug that appears in the detective's office;
- Fixed some missing collision;

